    mahjong_kw("halloween-mahjong.html", "Halloween Party", "Halloween mahjong party — spooky season game night.", "halloween mahjong, halloween mah jongg party", "Halloween Mahjong", "<p><strong>Halloween mahjong</strong> — the classy alternative to another costume bar crawl. <a href=\"girls-night-mahjong.html\">Girls night</a> · <a href=\"fall-mahjong.html\">Fall</a>.</p>"),
