    mahjong_kw("derby-party-mahjong.html", "Derby Party", "Kentucky Derby party mahjong — Southern gathering with tiles.", "derby party mahjong, kentucky derby mah jongg", "Derby Party Mahjong", "<p>Hats, bourbon, and <strong>Derby party mahjong</strong> — the Southern trifecta. <a href=\"southern-mahjong.html\">Southern mahjong</a> · <a href=\"wine-and-mahjong.html\">Wine &amp; mahjong</a>.</p>"),
