    mahjong_kw("optional-pass-mahjong.html", "Optional Pass (Blind Pass)", "Optional pass in mahjong — blind pass during the Charleston.", "optional pass mahjong, blind pass charleston mah jongg", "Optional Pass in the Charleston", "<p>The <strong>optional pass</strong> (blind pass) during the Charleston — a key American mahjong rule. Learn it in <a href=\"mahjong-101.html\">Mahjong 101</a> · <a href=\"mahjong-charleston.html\">Charleston guide</a>.</p>"),
