    mahjong_kw("gender-reveal-mahjong.html", "Gender Reveal", "Gender reveal mahjong — unique party activity with tiles.", "gender reveal mahjong, mah jongg gender reveal party", "Gender Reveal Mahjong", "<p>Skip the balloon — host a <strong>gender reveal mahjong</strong> lesson instead. <a href=\"baby-shower-mahjong.html\">Baby shower</a> · <a href=\"book-mahjong-lesson.html\">Book</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("tea-party-mahjong.html", "Tea Party", "Tea party mahjong — afternoon tea and tiles.", "tea party mahjong, mah jongg tea party", "Tea Party Mahjong", "<p>The perfect <strong>tea party mahjong</strong> format — scones, tea, and tiles. <a href=\"ladies-luncheon-mahjong.html\">Ladies luncheon</a> · <a href=\"bridal-brunch-mahjong.html\">Bridal brunch</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("wine-tasting-mahjong.html", "Wine Tasting", "Wine tasting mahjong — sip and learn format.", "wine tasting mahjong, mah jongg wine tasting party", "Wine Tasting Mahjong", "<p>Pair a <strong>wine tasting</strong> with a mahjong lesson — our most popular format. <a href=\"wine-and-mahjong.html\">Wine &amp; mahjong</a> · <a href=\"cocktail-mahjong.html\">Cocktail party</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("craft-night-mahjong.html", "Craft Night", "Craft night mahjong — swap your usual craft for tiles.", "craft night mahjong, mah jongg craft group", "Craft Night Mahjong", "<p>Your <strong>craft night</strong> crew needs a new activity — book <a href=\"mahjong-101.html\">Mahjong 101</a>. <a href=\"knitting-circle-mahjong.html\">Knitting circle</a> · <a href=\"book-club-mahjong.html\">Book club swap</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("monthly-mahjong-club.html", "Monthly Mahjong Club", "Monthly mahjong club — recurring group lessons.", "monthly mahjong club, mah jongg club monthly", "Monthly Mahjong Club", "<p>Start a <strong>monthly mahjong club</strong> — we teach your group and level up each session. <a href=\"mahjong-102.html\">Mahjong 102</a> · <a href=\"private-mahjong-lessons.html\">Private lessons</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("mahjong-lunch-bunch.html", "Lunch Bunch", "Mahjong lunch bunch — midday social with tiles.", "mahjong lunch bunch, lunch bunch mah jongg", "Mahjong Lunch Bunch", "<p>The <strong>lunch bunch</strong> format — gather midday, learn mahjong, stay for lunch. <a href=\"ladies-luncheon-mahjong.html\">Ladies luncheon</a> · <a href=\"country-club-brunch-mahjong.html\">Country club brunch</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("exposed-hand-mahjong.html", "Exposed Hand", "Exposed hand in mahjong — calling and exposing tiles on the table.", "exposed hand mahjong, mah jongg expose tiles", "Exposed Hand in Mahjong", "<p>An <strong>exposed hand</strong> shows called tiles face-up on the rack — required for many NMJL wins. Learn calling in <a href=\"calling-mahjong.html\">Calling</a> · <a href=\"mahjong-101.html\">101</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("foul-hand-mahjong.html", "Foul Hand", "Foul hand in mahjong — illegal exposures and table errors.", "foul hand mahjong, mah jongg foul rules", "Foul Hand in Mahjong", "<p>A <strong>foul hand</strong> breaks NMJL rules — wrong exposure or out-of-turn play. We teach clean play in <a href=\"mahjong-101.html\">Mahjong 101</a> · <a href=\"dead-hand-mahjong.html\">Dead hand</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("consecutive-numbers-mahjong.html", "Consecutive Numbers", "Consecutive numbers in mahjong — sequential tile hands on the NMJL card.", "consecutive numbers mahjong, consecutives mah jongg", "Consecutive Numbers in Mahjong", "<p><strong>Consecutive numbers</strong> hands use tiles in sequence — related to runs on the NMJL card. <a href=\"mahjong-runs.html\">Runs</a> · <a href=\"read-nmjl-card.html\">Read the card</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("any-like-numbers-mahjong.html", "Any Like Numbers", "Any like numbers in mahjong — flexible matching digit hands.", "any like numbers mahjong, mah jongg any like numbers", "Any Like Numbers in Mahjong", "<p><strong>Any like numbers</strong> lets you pick matching digits across suits — a versatile NMJL category. <a href=\"like-numbers-mahjong.html\">Like numbers</a> · <a href=\"mahjong-hands.html\">Hands</a>.</p>"),
    mahjong_kw("switch-hand-mahjong.html", "Switch Your Hand", "Switch hand in mahjong — changing strategy mid-game.", "switch hand mahjong, mah jongg change hand strategy", "Switch Your Hand in Mahjong", "<p>Knowing when to <strong>switch hands</strong> separates good players from great ones. Strategy in <a href=\"hand-selection-mahjong.html\">Hand selection</a> · <a href=\"mahjong-102.html\">102</a>.</p>"),
